Initial peeked message inject succeeds; second message arrives between peek and poll. Poll drains both; second injection declines. Inbox empty, delivered count1, late message not marked/delivered; warning log is only fallback. Source delivery.py _inject_drained / drain_and_inject. Require selective ack or durable retry for drained extras, restart-safe retry, safe logging (not sole storage), and failure/arrival interleaving tests. Preserve initial peek-inject-drain refusal semantics.

## Evidence and scope
