Execution lane and decision (2026-10-22): Decision: shared runtime lane B372→B373→B374→B375. Prefer existing selected-message acknowledgment primitives over destructive poll; if a durable retry is necessary, persist before removal and preserve original IDs. Logging is not a delivery store. Test late arrivals, refusal, restart and privacy boundaries.